# Secrets — this is an OPEN-SOURCE / public repo, so NOTHING real is committed here,
# not even sops-encrypted files. Only the *.example templates are tracked. Keep your
# real secrets (the sops .enc files or plaintext .env) in a SEPARATE private repo or a
# password manager, and clone/restore them into secrets/ at deploy time. See README
# "Code delivery & disaster recovery".
secrets/*
!secrets/*.example

# Rendered configs (produced from *.template by bootstrap/setup via envsubst).
vps/sing-box/config.json
mac-mini/sing-box/config.json
mac-mini/launchd/com.crossborder.singbox.plist
client/clash-meta.yaml

# Runtime state / data
**/cache.db
vps/acme/
vps/data/
**/.DS_Store

# age private key, if a copy ever lands here
*.agekey
key.txt
